## 13. Trademarks and Product Names

This license does not automatically grant ownership of or unrestricted rights to trademarks, registered marks, or other branding owned by the original author or third parties.

Users may rename and rebrand their own versions of the Software, subject to applicable trademark laws and third-party rights.

The OpenWhispr name and logo are not automatically transferred to users through this license.

