## 15. No Obligation to Provide Support

The original author and contributors are not obligated to provide technical support, maintenance, updates, bug fixes, hosting, or continued development.

Anyone may independently maintain, fork, discontinue, or further develop their own version of the Software.

## 16. Freedom of Independent Development

Anyone may develop their version of the Software independently and may discontinue their association with the original project.

Users are not required to seek approval from the original author before making changes, renaming their version, selling it, or transferring their own derivative project, provided they comply with this license and applicable law.

